    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d363-a2">

                <pb facs="0734" n="624" xml:id="pg624"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure A in inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Work to Mr.
                            Ryan.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Victoria</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 3,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Permit me to submit to you the
                    inclosed letter of Don Juan Cortina.</p>
                <p>I further state that I can get no one to defend me in the pending trial before
                    the second sala. My witnesses volunteer to come forward to testify. Hope you
                    will press this to a close. My family and self are suffering for the actual want
                    of provisions to live on.</p>
                <p>Hope you will excuse one in suffering. I am not an assassin, much less a
                    murderer. What I had to do, could I have saved my own life by not doing so, I
                    would have never taken the life of anyone.</p>
                <p>Yours, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. C. Work.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
